# Source images dropped in by hand. A file in this repository makes its
# licence this project's problem (LEVELPACK.md), and a drop folder fills up
# with things nobody re-read the terms of. Inputs stay out; an installed pack
# under web/public/packs/ is the tracked output, and carries its provenance.
Artwork/*
